  "item_short_desc": "<p>Built for action and designed for comfort, our Vintage Utility Cargo Shorts are your go-to for outdoor adventure and everyday wear. Made from breathable cotton, they&rsquo;re rugged, reliable, and prewashed for a perfect fit. With 7 spacious utility pockets and adjustable features, these vintage military-styled shorts keep your essentials secure while offering all-day comfort- whether you're hiking, fishing, working, or just kicking back.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "15506",
  "description": "<p>Built for action and designed for comfort, our Vintage Utility Cargo Shorts are your go-to for outdoor adventure and everyday wear. Made from breathable cotton, they&rsquo;re rugged, reliable, and prewashed for a perfect fit. With 7 spacious utility pockets and adjustable features, these vintage military-styled shorts keep your essentials secure while offering all-day comfort- whether you're hiking, fishing, working, or just kicking back. Rugged &amp; Long-Lasting: Constructed from comfortable cotton fabric, our Vintage Utility Cargo Shorts are breathable and easily withstand rigorous outdoor use. The military cargo shorts aren&rsquo;t afraid to get down and dirty, and are perfect for various outdoor activities, such as camping, hiking, fishing, and even skateboarding. High-Capacity Storage: The hiking shorts provide functional utility through 2 pleated cargo pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for storing tactical gear and everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Unparalleled Comfort: With a button-up waist and a zipper fly these tactical shorts offer comfortable all-day wear and adaptability, while the adjustable waist and leg drawstrings enable you to find the perfect fit.&nbsp; Perfect Fit: The outdoor cargo shorts are washed for a vintage look and feel; this prewash also helps prevent any unnecessary shrinking. The utility shorts are designed with a knee-length inseam that falls just above the knees for additional protection and coverage. Action Ready: From the trails to daily life, these adaptable and reliable vintage military-styled shorts are great for backpacking, camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, working, public safety, skateboarding, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
